; Eio_main picks io_uring on Linux, and each ring pins a few MiB of locked
; memory against the user's RLIMIT_MEMLOCK (8 MiB here). Dune runs the suites
; in parallel, so under io_uring they fail with ENOMEM in io_uring_queue_init.
; The suites test Ox's semantics, not the backend: run them on eio_posix.

